{"id":"n84694-1-9","stage":2,"title":"포장지 · 包装纸","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84694-1-9-1","ko":"여기 선물이야.","zh":"这是给你的礼物哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"선물이야.","meaning":"礼物","explanation":"선물：礼物；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"선물","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36685","senseId":"1","lemma":"선물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"807cae1b57085769","term":"선물","zh":"礼物","audio":"/audio/807cae1b570857696082.mp3","entryId":"36685","definition":"为表达谢意或祝贺某事而把东西送给别人；或指该东西。","pronunciation":["선ː물"]}],"audio":"/audio/501cce87f1fe7f099cec.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n84694-1-9-2","ko":"어머, 고마워. 예쁜 포장지로 포장까지 했네?","zh":"哎呀，谢谢。还用这么漂亮的包装纸包装起来了呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머,","meaning":"哎哟，哦","explanation":"어머：哎哟，哦","readings":[{"term":"어머","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30195","senseId":"1","lemma":"어머","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고마워.","meaning":"感谢，感激","explanation":"고맙다：感谢，感激；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"고맙다","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20041","senseId":"1","lemma":"고맙다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예쁜","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"포장지로","meaning":"包装纸","explanation":"포장지：包装纸；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"포장지","audio":"/audio/bb5bd83c764703192ba7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84694","senseId":"1","lemma":"포장지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"포장까지","meaning":"包装，打包","explanation":"포장：包装，打包；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"포장","audio":"/audio/2bafb453d96b37257775.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71349","senseId":"1","lemma":"포장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했네?","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9a1c609712d2db0e","term":"어머","zh":"哎哟，哦","audio":"/audio/9a1c609712d2db0e30b8.mp3","entryId":"30195","definition":"主要是女性因没料到的事情感到惊讶或感叹时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["어머"]},{"id":"ded2b4943e89f57d","term":"고맙다","zh":"感谢，感激","audio":"/audio/ded2b4943e89f57dd33d.mp3","entryId":"20041","definition":"因别人为自己做了什么，内心感到很满足，并想给予回报。","pronunciation":["고ː맙따"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]},{"id":"bb5bd83c76470319","term":"포장지","zh":"包装纸","audio":"/audio/bb5bd83c764703192ba7.mp3","entryId":"84694","definition":"用于包裹东西的纸或塑料。","pronunciation":["포장지"]},{"id":"2bafb453d96b3725","term":"포장","zh":"包装，打包","audio":"/audio/2bafb453d96b37257775.mp3","entryId":"71349","definition":"包裹或捆扎物品；或用于这方面的材料。","pronunciation":["포장"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，作，置办","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"制作或准备什么东西。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/46aa617fff451f65cd71.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.925,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=84694","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":64,"sequenceScore":1.5784,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这是给你的礼物哦。","哎呀，谢谢。还用这么漂亮的包装纸包装起来了呢？","最近钱总是不够用。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这是给你的礼物哦。","哎呀，谢谢。还用这么漂亮的包装纸包装起来了呢？","最近钱总是不够用。"],"answer":1}]}
